  "findings": [
    "Original submitted outputs had glyph inactive due loader reinitialization; corrected results and no-glyph inference ablation separated",
    "Correctness gains paired CIs cross zero; Warp-c and Flicker-c worsen with glyph, perceptual MUSIQ-c improves",
    "Human studies and Composite pipeline check still use earlier no-glyph outputs",
    "Subset substring match ignores candidate prefix/suffix; L/N-only normalizer drops symbols and marks",
    "Core says mask-ranking tau.94; AppL says.89, unresolved",
    "AppE margin16px versus code10percent; Source theoretical infinite PSNR versus code/results cap100dB",
    "README claims per-clip OCR strings but released2041records have none; cannot redo text metric from release alone",
    "Flat glyph latent pooling has no explicit position indexing in selected code; temporal information may remain in VAE, requires controlled permutation test",
    "Current evaluation skips missing files/OCR and truncates to common length; published records cover157 each but new submissions need completeness reporting"
